            SimplifiedChineseLanguagePackPlugin.Translate(SimplifiedChineseLanguagePackPlugin.GUID, null, "[creature] submerges itself during its opponent's turn. While submerged, opposing creatures attack its owner directly, unless that creature has this sigil.", "[creature] s'immerge pendant le tour de son adversaire. Tant qu'elle est immergée, les créatures ennemies attaquent directement son propriétaire, sauf si elles portent aussi cet emblème.", Language.French);

